-- Ordered quest guidance; source 967020b2b8ca645afcaf90d9bbe5a1b64673947d; generated 2026-10-20.
QuestGuidance.Register("en",192,{
[6113]="70058515\n1\tInjured scouts are scattered in and around Annâk-khurfu. You should tend to their wounds.\t\n2\tTalk to Lóssi\tYou have tended to the injured scouts. Lóssi, who is at Annâk-khurfu, will want to know.\n",
[6114]="70042F5A\n1\tRecover hidden food-stores from the Houses of Healing (total: 8)\030Recover stores of athelas from the Houses of Healing (total: 6)\tFood-stores and athelas can be found within the Houses of Healing in eastern Osgiliath. Golthor has asked you to recover hidden stores of food and athelas that were stowed away by the Rangers for times of war.\n2\tDeliver the recovered goods to Golthor\tGolthor can be found outside the Houses of Healing in eastern Osgiliath. You have recovered many food-stores and bundles of athelas and should now deliver them to Golthor.\n",
[6115]="7006836A\n1\tCollect heaps of dung ([see journal]/20)\tAbido asked you to help him obtain twenty heaps of dung to send back to outfitters in the city. It matters only that the dung comes from wild hogs or buffalo that make the crags and desert of the Cape of Umbar their habitat.\n2\tReturn the heaps of dung to Abido\tYour task is complete, and none too soon. Return the dung to Abido at the hunter's expedition in the south-east of the Cape of Umbar.\n",
[6116]="7005F6BA\n1\tDefeat Glérgangol in Glittengrof\030Defeat glass-spider queens in Glittengrof (total: 3)\tGlérgangol can be found in Glittengrof in Gloomingtarn. Vithin has asked you to seek out the elusive Glérgangol and put an end to her before her brood overwhelms Gloomingtarn and the rest of Mount Gundabad.\n2\tTalk to Vithin in Glittengrof\tVithin can be found in Glittengrof in Gloomingtarn. You have defeated Glérgangol and done much to hinder the glass-spiders invading Glittengrof. You should return to Vithin.\n",
[6117]="70000195\n1\tTalk to Rhúnelleth\tTármunn Súrsa is north-west from Gath Forthnír, past the Gates of Carn Dûm. Fimreg has asked you to speak with Rhúnelleth in Tármunn Súrsa.\n2\tDefeat Helchgam\tHelchgam lurks in the waters of Carn Dûm, beyond the gates to the west of Himbar. Rhúnelleth revealed the source of the poison to be a many-armed creature she called Helchgam.\n3\tTalk to Rhúnelleth\tRhúnelleth is in Tármunn Súrsa to the east of Carn Dûm. You travelled far into Carn Dûm and slew the dread beast known as Helchgam.\n",
[6118]="7002F988\n1\tDefeat the Uruk-hai Looter and collect his stolen valuables\tThe Uruk-hai looter has been seen by Randgar travelling between many of the deserted homes south of Randgar's farm. Randgar has guessed that the Uruk-hai looter may be carrying enough valuables to impress Inhild's father, if Randgar were to possess them, and wishes you to obtain them.\n2\tReturn to Randgar at the farmstead\tRandgar lives on a small farm, south and east of Cliving, along the road. The Uruk-hai looter bore none of the valuables that Randgar had hoped for, and a new course of action must be taken. You should return to Randgar and let him know.\n3\tExamine the discarded spear\030Examine the discarded cloak\tRandgar lives on a small farm, south and east of Cliving, along the road. Randgar is not to be seen. Several things at the farm seem amiss and worth inspecting.\n4\tBring Randgar's cloak to Inhild in Cliving\tInhild resides at an estate, just east of the central fountain in Cliving, with her father. With Randgar missing and a disturbed scene found at his home, Inhild should be informed of the events that have transpired.\n",
[6119]="70030809\n1\tCollect corrupt heartwood (total: 10)\tCorrupted heartwood can be found on Huorns throughout Fangorn's Black Heart. You should defeat Huorns and see if they show signs of being internally corrupted.\n2\tCompleted\tYou have gathered evidence that the environment here makes the trees twisted and sick. Their blackened, corrupted heartwood is likely the reason they are so aggressive in this part of the forest.\n",
[6120]="7004E925\n1\tDefeat fierce cold-drakes and frost grims\tYou should defeat any fierce cold-drakes and grims that you find while exploring the Withered Heath.\n2\tDefeat fierce cold-drakes (total: 8)\030Defeat frost grims (total: 6)\tYou should defeat any drakes that you find while exploring the Withered Heath.\n3\tCompleted\tDefeated fierce cold-drakes and frost grims.\n",
[6121]="70027B06\n1\tTalk to Sagrúrz in Isengard\tSagrúrz is in the centre of the main cavern beneath Isengard. Your Uruk-hai overseer has another task for you, this one near the great forges in the centre of the caverns.\n2\tPick up a barrel of weapons\tSagrúrz wants you to carry heavy barrels of armour and weapons up the slope to the north and to leave them on the wooden platform directly above Fâsh with the others.\n3\tPick up a barrel of armour\tSagrúrz wants you to carry heavy barrels of armour and weapons up the slope to the north and to leave them on the wooden platform directly above Fâsh with the others.\n4\tTalk to Sagrúrz in Isengard\tSagrúrz is waiting in the centre of the main cavern beneath Isengard.\n5\tTalk to Kenned in Isengard\tThe prisoner Kenned is exhausted and cannot carry the barrel Sagrúrz wants him to.\n6\tPick up Kenned's barrel of weapons\tKenned's barrel of weapons is right next to him. Kenned cannot carry the barrel of weapons Sagrúrz has charged him to carry, so you are going to carry it for him.\n7\tTalk to Sagrúrz in Isengard\tSagrúrz is in the centre of the main cavern beneath Isengard.\n",
[6122]="7005294A\n1\tTalk to Radagast\tRadagast can be found in Blómgard. You should talk to Radagast.\n2\tTalk to Radagast at Rhosgobel\tRadagast can be found in Rhosgobel. You should talk to Radagast.\n",
[6123]="7000885C\n1\tReturn to Lieutenant Swithulf at the Grimwood Lumber-yard\030Collect Grimwood-logs (total: 5)\030Collect unrefined Isendeep-ore (total: 5)\tOre can be found on the Snowreap-goblins or in the depths of the Isendeep. Logs can be found on Leafcull-trees or scattered on the ground within the Grimwood. Lieutenant Swithulf directed you to collect the ore and wood he needs and return to him at the Grimwood Lumber-yard.\n",
[6124]="700686A7\n1\tDefeat Heirsworn Corsairs in the Sail-haven (total: 18)\tHeirsworn Corsairs can be found around their ships at the northern and southern piers of the Sail-haven, as well as at the southern ship-yard of the Sail-haven. Eshmun has asked you to defeat Heirsworn Corsairs in the Sail-haven.\n2\tTalk to Eshmun at the Harbour-warden's Tower\tEshmun, Captain of the Haven, can be found at the Harbour-warden's Tower in the Sail-haven of Umbar Baharbêl. You have defeated many of the Heirsworn Corsairs troubling the people of the Sail-haven. You should return to Eshmun.\n",
[6125]="70068A37\n1\tMeet Eshmun at the Bloody Eagle\tThe Bloody Eagle is a tavern located to the east of the Harbour-warden's Tower in the Sail-haven of Umbar Baharbêl. Eshmun has asked you to meet him at the Bloody Eagle to celebrate your victory over the Heirsworn in the Sail-haven. You should meet Eshmun at the Bloody Eagle.\n2\tTalk to Eshmun in the Bloody Eagle\tEshmun can be found in the Bloody Eagle, a tavern located to the east of the Harbour-warden's Tower in the Sail-haven of Umbar Baharbêl. You have found Eshmun in the Bloody Eagle. You should talk to Eshmun.\n3\tExamine Akurga's spear in the Bloody Eagle\tAkurga's spear can be found behind the bar in the rear of the Bloody Eagle. Eshmun has asked you to examine Akurga's spear in the Bloody Eagle.\n4\tTalk to Akálam in the Bloody Eagle\tAkálam can be found behind the bar in the rear of the Bloody Eagle. After inspecting Akurga's spear, you have caught the attention of the tavern keep of the Bloody Eagle, Akálam. You should talk to Akálam.\n5\tListen to Akálam's tale of the bane of Umbar\tAkálam is telling his tale of the bane of Umbar in the Bloody Eagle. After speaking with Akálam, you believe you know the identity of the bane of Umbar. You should continue to listen to his tale.\n6\tTalk to Akálam in the Bloody Eagle\tAkálam can be found behind the bar in the rear of the Bloody Eagle. Akálam has nearly concluded his tale of the bane of Umbar. You should talk to Akálam.\n7\tTalk to Khôltekh the Cunning in the Bloody Eagle\tKhôltekh the Cunning can be found in the Bloody Eagle, in the Sail-haven. After listening to Akálam's tale, you heard a chuckle at the end of the bar in the Bloody Eagle, and it appears that Khôltekh the Cunning, one of the Kindred of the Coins, was amused by some aspect of Akálam's tale.\n8\tTalk to Eshmun in the Bloody Eagle\tEshmun can be found in the Bloody Eagle, a tavern located to the east of the Harbour-warden's Tower in the Sail-haven of Umbar Baharbêl. After having an uncomfortable talk with Khôltekh the Cunning, you decide you should return to Eshmun in the Bloody Eagle.\n",
[6126]="7006071C\n1\tTalk to Helchon outside the ruins of Thelgarth, high above Tornhad\tHelchon's duty for the day requires him to patrol near the ruins of Thelgarth, to the south and high above Tornhad. He has agreed to meet you there.\n2\tTalk to Helchon in Tornhad\tHis patrol completed, Helchon waits for you back outside Tornhad.\n",
[6127]="70029FD4\n1\tComplete 'Helegrod Drake' in a raid group\tGrisgart and the drake-brood under his command present a terrible threat to Rivendell.\n",
[6128]="70029FD7\n1\tComplete 'Helegrod Drugoth' in a raid group\tDrugoth stands atop the peak of Helegrod.\n",
[6129]="70029FD6\n1\tComplete 'Helegrod Giant' in a raid group\tThe giant-chieftain Storvâgûn and his kin have fallen under the sway of Angmar and guard the passes into Helegrod.\n",
[6130]="70029FD5\n1\tComplete 'Helegrod Spider' in a raid group\tAmong the caves of Helegrod dwell the brood of the spider Zaudru.\n",
[6131]="70016027\n1\tFind the statue's arm\tThe statue's arm is at Sulnul-dûm, east of Tharâkh Bazân. You should collect the arm of Helgi Goblinbane's statue.\n2\tTalk to Arnod at Tharâkh Bazân\tArnod is at Tharâkh Bazân, west of Sulnul-dûm. Arnod will be delighted to hear you found the statue-piece.\n",
[6132]="70016D0A\n1\tBring the statue-piece to Simbi in the Twenty-first Hall\tSimbi is in the Twenty-first Hall. You have found a piece of the shattered statue of Helgi Goblinbane, and should bring it to a dwarf who will deliver it to Uxi.\n",
[6133]="70016D09\n1\tFind the statue-piece\tThe shoulder of the Helgi Goblinbane statue is in Hurmulkezer, a Ghâsh-hai camp to the south of Anazârmekhem in the Flaming Deeps. You should collect the statue-piece for Uxi's collection.\n2\tSpeak with Markthor at The Cross-roads of Ash\tMarkthor is at The Cross-roads of Ash, west of Hurmulkezer. Markthor will want to know the statue's shoulder is safe, so that it can be sent to Uxi for reassembling.\n",
[6134]="70016D0B\n1\tRecover the statue-piece\tThe statue-piece can be found in the middle of the Redhorn Lodes. You should bring the statue-piece to someone in the Redhorn Lodes.\n2\tBring the statue-piece to Knakk\tKnakk is at a hidden camp, located on the elevated walkway in the north-east corner of the Redhorn Lodes. You should bring the statue-piece to Knakk, who can send it along to Uxi in the Chamber of the Cross-roads to be reassembled.\n",
[6135]="700377A1\n1\tSpeak to Gamling when you are ready to begin\t\n2\tDefend the Dike and buy the primary defence time\tThe defenders of the Hornburg are busy preparing for the onslaught that will soon begin. Those left at the Dike must buy them as much time as possible.\n",
[6136]="70037DD3\n1\tProtect the Dike\t\n",
[6137]="70036C5C\n1\tExamine fortifications at Helm's Gate (total: 4)\030Examine the gate\tFortifications can be found around the gate at Helm's Dike. You should examine the various fortifications of the Rohirrim.\n2\tTell Gimli your observations of the fortifications at Helm's Gate\tGimli stands at Helm's Gate in the southern Westfold. You should speak with Gimli.\n",
[6138]="70036C96\n1\tLegolas stands at Helm's Dike, his gaze cast northward. You should look to the north to get a look at the troubled plains.\t\n2\tSpeak with Legolas about what you saw\tLegolas stands with the King's host at Helm's Gate. You should return and speak with Legolas.\n3\tCount barrels of arrows stored at Helm's Gate\tBarrels of arrows can be found lining the wall at Helm's Gate. You should count the barrels to see if the archers at Helm's Dike have enough arrows to defend Helm's Deep.\n4\tReturn to Legolas\tLegolas stands at Helm's Gate. You should return and speak with Legolas.\n",
[6139]="70036E9A\n1\tMen can be found along Helm's Dike, manning the gate to Helm's Deep. Aragorn has asked you to cheer up the men. NOTE: This quest requires emotes. You must select your target and type the correct \"/emote\" into the chat box.\t\n2\tReturn to Aragorn\tAragorn can be found at Helm's Gate in the southern Westfold. You should speak with Aragorn.\n",
[6140]="7003A962\n1\tDeliver the clipped ears to a collection box\030Collect clipped ears (total: 10)\tYou have accepted a task to acquire trophies from battle.\n",
[6141]="7003A95A\n1\tDeliver the clipped wings to a collection box\030Collect clipped wings (total: 10)\tYou have accepted a task to acquire trophies from battle.\n",
