[6143]="7003A95E\n1\tDeliver the pitted sword sheaths to a collection box\030Collect pitted sword sheaths (total: 10)\tYou have accepted a task to acquire trophies from battle.\n",
[6144]="7003A956\n1\tDeliver the shattered hatchets to a collection box\030Collect shattered hatchets (total: 10)\tYou have accepted a task to acquire trophies from battle.\n",
